        Tolstogo Street, Moscow, Russia, 119021. The abovementioned personal data will not be
        transferred to other countries.
    </p>

    <p>    For the purposes of this Consent, the processing of personal data means the
        collection, recording, systematisation, accumulation, clarification, updating, modification,
        use, transfer, disclosure, anonymisation, blocking, deletion, destruction and storage of
        personal data by the Personal Data Operator as provided for by the applicable legislation of
        the Russian Federation.
    </p>

    <p>    The personal data of the Data Subject are processed for the following purposes:
        analysing user behaviour; aggregating statistical data on Website traffic over selected
        periods; analysing Website traffic trends; evaluating the effectiveness of traffic sources;
