        and quality of the Website; and obtaining statistical information. When personal data are
        collected, their recording, systematisation, accumulation, storage, clarification (updating
        and modification) and retrieval of personal data are carried out using databases located
        within the territory of the Russian Federation.
    </p>

    <p>    The processing of the Data Subject’s personal data may be carried out with and/or
